## User Story 13 – Customer Profile Management
**Title:** Customer Profile Management  
**Priority:** Medium  
**Estimate:** 3 Ideal Days  

### Description
As a customer,  
I want to view my profile information and account settings,  
So that I can manage my account details and quickly access personal options.

### Acceptance Criteria
- Customer profile card is displayed in settings  
- Username/avatar is visible  
- Easy access to saved stores  
- Easy access to order history  
- Navigation is available from settings page  

### Business Value
Improves user convenience and strengthens long-term account engagement.

