## User Story 14 – Theme & Accent Personalisation
**Title:** Theme & Accent Personalisation  
**Priority:** Medium  
**Estimate:** 2 Ideal Days  

### Description
As a customer,  
I want to customise the app theme and accent colours,  
So that I can personalise the app experience.

### Acceptance Criteria
- Dark mode toggle is available  
- Accent colour options are available  
- Theme changes instantly  
- Reset settings button is available  
- Preference is retained during session  

### Business Value
Improves user satisfaction, accessibility, and app personalisation.
